_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a method paper for spatial marker gene detection in imaging-based spatial transcriptomics. The bridge is between spatial coordinates and gene detections, not text.","evidence_snippet":"\"hybrid approach to prioritize marker genes\" using \"spatial coordinates\" and linear models"},{"record_id":"rec_003733","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The record concerns gene expression prediction from multimodal signals and a DNA language model. No substantive natural-language/text component or text-bio bridge is described.","evidence_snippet":"\"Effective Integration of Multimodal Signals for Gene Expression Prediction\"; \"DNA language model grover\""},{"record_id":"rec_003734","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The paper applies existing foundation models BulkFormer and TabPFN in a zero-shot prediction pipeline. This is an application wrapper around existing models rather than a new text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"using BulkFormer-TabPFN v2.5\" and \"without retraining\" on RNA-Seq count data"},{"record_id":"rec_003735","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title is broad and the abstract snippet cites existing models rather than presenting a new one. This reads as a review or overview of foundation models for precision medicine.","eviden