ork (GCN)\"; \"gene expression, protein expression, and epigenetic features\""},{"record_id":"rec_001716","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"GE2Hist generates histological images from single-cell gene expression using a conditional diffusion model. The text/language side is absent.","evidence_snippet":"\"Generating Histology Images from Single-Cell Gene Expression via Cross-Modal Generative Network\"; \"conditional diffusion model\""},{"record_id":"rec_001717","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"TCN-5mC is a deep learning predictor for 5mC sites using one-hot and nucleotide chemical property encoding. No substantive text component is described.","evidence_snippet":"\"a predictor of 5-methylcytosine sites\"; \"hybrid One-Hot and Nucleotide Chemical Property feature encoding\""},{"record_id":"rec_001718","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"SpatialFormer learns from spatial transcriptomics and spatial gene-expression context with CNNs and transformers. The abstract does not describe a text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"learn single-cell multimodal and multi-scale information\"; \"expression data and subcellular gene spatial distribution\""},{"record_id":"rec_001719","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"scFormer is a transformer-based framework that jointly learns cell and gene embeddings and uses masked gene modelling. The abstract explicitly links NLP-style modeling to genomics.","evidence_snippet":"\"draw parallels between natural language processing and genomics\"; \"masked gene modelling\""},{"record_id":"rec_001720","paper_type":"unclear","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"paper_type_unclear","decision_rationale":"This is a developmental biology study based on single-cell RNA sequencing, GRN screens, and lineage reconstruction. The abstract does not present a candidate text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"combine single-cell RNA sequencing\"; \"gene regulatory network (GRN) screens\"; \"genetic lineage reconstruction\""}]}
