"text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"generative_status_unclear","decision_rationale":"The title explicitly presents an image-gene foundation model, and the abstract mentions an explicit deep language model used in the method. The fragment is still too thin to confirm generative behavior.","evidence_snippet":"“Multi-Scale Image-Gene Foundation Modeling” and “injects an explicit deep language model”"},{"record_id":"rec_003622","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title explicitly identifies the work as a survey of methods, limitations, and prospects. The abstract summarizes genomic language models rather than presenting a primary model.","evidence_snippet":"“A Survey of Methods, Limitations, and Prospects”"},{"record_id":"rec_003623","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract is argumentative and prospective, saying “we argue” and discussing what could be done in future models. It does not report a new model.","evidence_snippet":"“we argue that decoding the functioning of the human genome”"}]}
