 text-bio foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"“integrating embedding features from diverse DNA language models”"},{"record_id":"rec_000819","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a comprehensive review of AI in IBD clinical trials. It mentions NLP and other AI applications, but does not describe a primary generative model.","evidence_snippet":"“a comprehensive review”; “including machine learning (ML), natural language processing, and predictive analytics”"},{"record_id":"rec_000820","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly says this paper summarizes recent progress in multimodal approaches for ocular adnexal lymphoma. It is a review, not a model paper.","evidence_snippet":"“This review summarizes recent progress”"},{"record_id":"rec_000821","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a literature analysis of digital twin technology in tumor therapy, focused on research trends and applications. It does not present a candidate generative model.","evidence_snippet":"“systematically analyze the current applications, research trends, and challenges”"}]}
./data/screening_codex_full_2026-07-06/role_logs/adjudicator/batch_0020.stdout.log:1:{"results":[{"record_id":"rec_000420","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly describes a systematic review of breast cancer risk prediction studies, not a primary model paper. It mentions imaging, genomics, and NLP-related work, but only as reviewed literature.","evidence_snippet":"\"This study presents a comprehensive overview...\" and \"systematically presented DL methods\""},{"record_id":"rec_000423","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a review of single-cell analysis concepts and methods. NLP is only mentioned as a possible aid, not as part of a model being proposed.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review attempts to explain the deeper theoretical concepts\" and \"NLP may help\""},{"record_id":"rec_000428","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes a prognostic algorithm built from clinical, genomic, and pathology data for survival prediction. This is a downstream application study, not a text-bio generative model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"develop a novel prognostic algorithm\" and \"survival prediction\""},{"record_id":"rec_000430","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_