rom h ( L src ) abl , manually propagate through all subsequent transformer layers, capturing h ( ℓ ) abl at each downstream layer ℓ &gt; L src .\n4. Downstream measurement. At each downstream layer ℓ , encode both clean and ablated hidden states through the downstream SAE:\n\n<!-- formula-not-decoded -->\n\nfor every downstream feature j .\n\n5. Statistical accumulation. Accumulate ∆ ( ℓ ) j across all cells using Welford's online algorithm [Welford, 1962] for numerically stable running mean and variance. This avoids storing per-cell results.\n\nAfter processing all cells, we compute for each source-target pair:\n\n- Cohen's d = ¯ ∆ j /s j [Cohen, 1988] where ¯ ∆ j is the mean delta and s j is the pooled standard deviation.\n- Consistency = fraction of cells where the delta has the same sign as the mean.\n\nAn edge is significant if | d | &gt; 0 . [truncated]","original_chars":14969}],"docling_markdown":"data/docling_uncertain_no_vlm_2026-07-08/markdown/full_2026_07_06_rec_003578.md","first_pass_outputs":{"scope_reviewer":{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_003578","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a primary methods paper on causal circuit tracing applied to single-cell foundation models. The candidate model centers on biological SAE features and cell data, with no substantive natural-language text component or text-bio bridge described.","evidence_snippet":"“apply it to Geneformer V2-316M and scGPT whole-human”; “single-cell foundation models”; “ablation of SAE features and measuring downstream responses”,"},"architecture_reviewer":{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_003578","paper_type":"application_wrapper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a mechanistic interpretability study that applies causal circuit tracing to existing models (Geneformer V2-316M and scGPT) rather than presenting a new generative text-bio model. The abstract and methods describe ablation/tracing over preexisting foundation models, not a candidate generative architecture.","evidence_snippet":"\"We introduce causal circuit tracing... and apply it to Geneformer V2-316M and scGPT whole-human\"; \"two single-cell foundation models\"; \"SAE enc (h(clean))\"; \"zero the activation of feature f\"; \"ablation delta\"; \"manually propagate through all subsequent transformer layers\""},"python_gate":{"provisional_decision":"ADJUDICATE","provisional_code":"EC2_no_text_component","adjudication_reason":"criterion_unclear_or_reviewer_conflict","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no"}}}]
