/Users/bogdan.didenko/lpnu/review/data/docling_uncertain_no_vlm_2026-07-08/chunks/full_2026_07_06_rec_003118.jsonl:86:{"candidate_id": "full_2026-07-06__rec_003118", "chunk_index": 86, "text": "- Qinghao Ye, Haiyang Xu, Jiabo Ye, Ming Yan, Anwen Hu, Haowei Liu, Qi Qian, Ji Zhang, and Fei Huang. mplug-owl2: Revolutionizing multi-modal large language model with modality collaboration. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition , pp. 13040-13051, 2024.\n- Meng Zhang, Xingjie Pan, Won Jung, Aaron R Halpern, Stephen W Eichhorn, Zhiyun Lei, Limor Cohen, Kimberly A Smith, Bosiljka Tasic, Zizhen Yao, et al. Molecularly defined and spatially resolved cell atlas of the whole mouse brain. Nature , 624(7991):343-354, 2023.\n- Sicheng Zhao, Bo Li, Pengfei Xu, and Kurt Keutzer. Multi-source domain adaptation in the deep learning era: A systematic survey. arXiv preprint arXiv:2002.12169 , 2020.", "contextualized_text": "5 CONCLUSION\nREFERENCES\n- Qinghao Ye, Haiyang Xu, Jiabo Ye, Ming Yan, Anwen Hu, Haowei Liu, Qi Qian, Ji Zhang, and Fei Huang. mplug-owl2: Revolutionizing multi-modal large language model with modality collaboration. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition , pp. 13040-13051, 2024.\n- Meng Zhang, Xingjie Pan, Won Jung, Aaron R Halpern, Stephen W Eichhorn, Zhiyun Lei, Limor Cohen, Kimberly A Smith, Bosiljka Tasic, Zizhen Yao, et al. Molecularly defined and spatially resolved cell atlas of the whole mouse brain. Nature , 624(7991):343-354, 2023.\n- Sicheng Zhao, Bo Li, Pengfei Xu, and Kurt Keutzer. Multi-source domain adaptation in the deep learning era: A systematic survey. arXiv preprint arXiv:2002.12169 , 2020.", "headings": ["5 CONCLUSION", "REFERENCES"], "pages": [14], "meta": {"schema_name": "docling_core.transforms.chunker.DocMeta", "version": "1.0.0", "doc_items": [{"self_ref": "#/texts/823", "parent": {"cref": "#/groups/5"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "meta":